hen does Ramadan 2026 start in UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Ramadan 2026 in the UAE is astronomically expected to begin on Tuesday, February 17, 2026. The official date will be confirmed by the UAE Moon Sighting Committee.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are the working hours during Ramadan 2026 in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Private sector employees in the UAE typically receive a two-hour reduction in daily working hours during Ramadan. Public sector timings are announced separately by the authorities.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When is Eid al-Fitr 2026 in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Eid al-Fitr 2026 in the UAE is expected to fall on March 19, 2026, subject to the official moon sighting.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long are fasting hours during Ramadan 2026 in the UAE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Fasting hours during Ramadan 2026 are expected to range between 13 and 14 hours per day, from Fajr until Maghrib.\"}}]}]}</script><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-7xl\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"w-full mb-4\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://toptenuae.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"What's On\",\"item\":\"https://toptenuae.com/events-holidays\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Ramadan 2026 UAE Dates, Iftar & Sehri Timings, Fasting Hours\",\"item\":\"https://toptenuae.com/events-holidays/ramadan-2026-uae\"}]}</script><ol class=\"flex items-center text-sm space-x-2 overflow-hidden flex-wrap\"><li class=\"flex items-center shrink-0\"><a class=\"text-gray-500 hover:text-[#4b0082] transition-colors flex items-center p-1 rounded hover:bg-black/5\" title=\"Back to Homepage\" aria-label